# Git Workflow

---

## Branch Naming

| Pattern | When to use | Example |
|---------|-------------|---------|
| `nt-<slug>` | Internal tasks without a ticket | `nt-decline-profile-status` |
| `<ticket>-<slug>` | Jira/tracker-linked work | `amnadeps-192-validation-errors` |

Slug rules: lowercase, hyphens only, descriptive of the feature (not `fix-stuff`).

---

## Commit Convention

Format: `[TICKET] imperative message`

```
[NT] Add decline profile mutation hook
[AMNADEPS-192] Show validation errors on document review page
[NT] Wire DeclineProfileFeature into ProfileDetailPage
```

Rules:
- Imperative mood ("Add", "Fix", "Wire", not "Added" or "Adds").
- One logical change per commit.
- No commit messages like "WIP", "fix", or "update".

---

## Rebase and Push

`/create-pr` inlines rebase + push. The sequence is:

1. `git fetch origin develop`
2. `git rebase origin/develop`
3. `git push --force-with-lease origin <branch>`

Never use `--force` (without `--lease`). `--force-with-lease` prevents overwriting remote commits you have not seen.

Never rebase or force-push `develop` or `main`.

---

## Protected Branches Policy

| Branch | Force-push | Rebase by automation | Direct commit |
|--------|-----------|----------------------|---------------|
| `main` | Never | Never | Never |
| `develop` | Never | Never | Never |
| `nt-*` / `<ticket>-*` | `--force-with-lease` only | Allowed | Allowed |

---

## Ship Flow

1. All quality gates must be green (see quality-gates.md).
2. Spec status must be `done` (human approved at station 12).
3. Human invokes `/create-pr` manually.
4. Automation (rebase, `--force-with-lease` push, `gh pr create`) runs only at human direction.

The orchestrator never invokes `/create-pr` autonomously.

---

## PR Body Template

`/create-pr` generates a PR body from the spec:

```markdown
## Summary
<2–3 sentences from spec Request + Clarifications>

## Acceptance Criteria
<numbered list from spec>

## FSD Impact
| Slice | Layer | Change |
|-------|-------|--------|

## Test Plan
- [ ] All quality gates pass (typecheck, lint, fsd-boundaries, build, coverage, auto-review)
- [ ] <manual test step derived from each AC>

## Spec
.spec/features/<slug>.md

🤖 Generated with Claude Code
```

---

## Pre-PR Checklist (automated verify before `gh pr create`)

- Branch is rebased on latest `develop` (no merge conflicts).
- `yarn lint` exits 0.
- `yarn typecheck` exits 0.
- `yarn build` succeeds.
- Spec status is `done`.
